## Off-Limits Directories [ORG-WIDE + CUSTOMIZE]

Claude must not modify files in these directories without explicit approval:

### Always Off-Limits [ORG-WIDE]
- `.github/` — CI/CD workflows require manual review before modification.
- `migrations/` — Database migrations must be authored and reviewed by a human.
- `scripts/deploy/` — Deployment scripts must not be modified by Claude.
- `.env*` — Environment files contain secrets.
- `Makefile` — Build infrastructure changes require team review.

### Project-Specific Off-Limits [CUSTOMIZE]
- [e.g., `src/config/production.ts` — Production config must be changed in a controlled process]
- [e.g., `certs/` — TLS certificates managed separately]

