## Review Steps Before Merging [ORG-WIDE]

Before asking Claude to open a PR or before opening one yourself after a Claude session:

1. Run the full test suite: `[INSERT TEST COMMAND]` — all tests must pass.
2. Run the linter: `[INSERT LINT COMMAND]` — no lint errors.
3. Run type checking: `[INSERT TYPE CHECK COMMAND]` — no type errors.
4. Review the diff manually in `git diff` — verify no unexpected files were changed.
5. Check that no files in the Off-Limits directories were modified.
6. Ensure no secrets, API keys, or tokens are in the diff.
7. Verify that new code has corresponding tests.

For PRs involving database schema changes, security-sensitive code, or external API contracts: assign an additional reviewer beyond the standard two.

